hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16841","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Isma'il ibn Ibrahim Abu Ma'mar al-Hudhali narrated to me, Sa'id ibn Khuthaym al-Hilali narrated to us, he said: My grandmother Umm Abi Rabi'a bint Iyad al-Kilabiyya narrated to me from her grandfather Ubayda ibn Amr al-Kilabi, he said: I saw the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) while he was performing ablution, and he performed the purification thoroughly. And she, when she performed ablution, would perform the purification thoroughly until she would lift the head covering and wipe her head."
"16842","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Uthman ibn Muhammad ibn Abi Shayba narrated to me, he said: Sa'id ibn Khuthaym al-Hilali narrated to us, he said: I heard my grandmother Rabi'a bint Iyad from her grandfather Ubayda ibn Amr al-Kilabi, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) perform ablution, and he performed the ablution thoroughly. He said: And Rabi'a, when she performed ablution, would perform the ablution thoroughly."
"16843","Abd Allah narrated to us, Amr ibn Muhammad al-Naqid narrated to me, he said: Sa'id ibn Khuthaym al-Hilali narrated to us, he said: My grandmother Rabi'a bint Iyad al-Kilabiyya narrated to me from her grandfather Ubayda ibn Amr al-Kilabi, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) performing ablution, and he performed the purification thoroughly. He said: And she, meaning his grandmother, when she took the purification water, would perform it thoroughly."
